messages.text:
The problem is: most here possibly do not understand what it is to have worked all night to isolate a sporadic bug, then immediately go to PC in the morning to look at the test-runs, open the dev channel to see if someone responded, to see only shit and the relevant messages ignored. So, one needs to look for blocking mechanisms now => kicked out of the work-flow that is supposed to make ERGO better.

@kushti_ru is clearly the project-lead, and thus the responsible for this.

So, me leaving this channel, I can accept some nonsense on main, but not in a dev channel.
